WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.528
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.798 --> 00:13.112
I like you.

3
00:14.997 --> 00:16.897
Will you go out with me?

4
00:24.935 --> 00:26.974
Well...

5
00:35.769 --> 00:37.597
I...

6
00:41.070 --> 00:46.508
I want to think it over before I give you my answer.

7
00:49.404 --> 00:51.221
So...

8
00:53.059 --> 00:57.301
could you give me some time to think?

9
01:09.738 --> 01:11.045
Okay.

10
01:15.204 --> 01:16.904
What should I do?

11
02:10.533 --> 02:12.246
Ms. Yamane.

12
02:12.246 --> 02:13.292
Yes?

13
02:13.292 --> 02:15.783
Documents for the field test.

14
02:15.783 --> 02:18.180
Someone from the parent company is coming,

15
02:18.180 --> 02:19.646
so I did them quickly.

16
02:19.646 --> 02:21.628
Thank you so much.

17
02:23.091 --> 02:27.059
Hey, I need to talk to you.

18
02:27.059 --> 02:28.830
Yes, what is it?

19
02:29.576 --> 02:32.875
Are you free tonight?

20
02:35.216 --> 02:38.391
I never imagined you'd ask me out, Ms. Ohata.

21
02:38.391 --> 02:41.101
And to such a lovely restaurant too.

22
02:43.032 --> 02:44.800
Here is your wine.

23
02:50.718 --> 02:54.231
I want to bring you here every day.

24
02:55.226 --> 02:57.524
Then we need to speak with the vendor.

25
02:57.524 --> 03:00.213
I want my team to rely on me,

26
03:00.213 --> 03:03.092
even though I might be overbearing.

27
03:03.092 --> 03:04.726
Want me to help?

28
03:04.726 --> 03:06.121
Ms. Yamane is...

29
03:06.121 --> 03:09.611
No, I'll do my best. Thank you.

30
03:09.611 --> 03:11.993
Does she think I'm unreliable?

31
03:13.148 --> 03:16.179
I think she's just being considerate.

32
03:16.918 --> 03:19.374
I hope so.

33
03:19.374 --> 03:23.732
I've noticed she's been acting strange lately.

34
03:23.732 --> 03:25.202
Ms. Yamane?

35
03:26.415 --> 03:31.211
Thank you for your concern. But I'll do my best.

36
03:35.663 --> 03:38.340
I see.

37
03:38.340 --> 03:39.993
That's tough.

38
03:41.375 --> 03:45.819
Honestly, Ms. Yamane is just so...

39
03:47.457 --> 03:52.167
so cute and easy to read!

40
03:53.771 --> 03:58.997
So... why did you invite me out today?

41
04:00.000 --> 04:04.917
You always work so hard, Ms. Yamane.

42
04:06.589 --> 04:08.188
But lately...

43
04:09.106 --> 04:11.797
you seem troubled about something.

44
04:20.310 --> 04:22.339
Like with Taguchi.

45
04:24.860 --> 04:27.167
Huh? H-How...

46
04:28.101 --> 04:30.630
Well, that's...

47
04:31.316 --> 04:33.425
I could tell just by looking.

48
04:35.923 --> 04:40.275
But... even if it's not about that,

49
04:40.275 --> 04:43.284
I just want to be there for you.

50
04:43.284 --> 04:45.509
That's just how I am as a boss.

51
04:47.926 --> 04:49.993
You can tell me anything.

52
04:54.147 --> 04:56.398
Well, actually...

53
04:57.763 --> 05:02.638
He told me that he likes me.

54
05:03.819 --> 05:05.039
Huh?

55
05:06.181 --> 05:07.181
Huh?

56
05:08.007 --> 05:10.386
You two weren't dating?

57
05:10.386 --> 05:14.773
Huh? N-No, we weren't!

58
05:14.773 --> 05:17.818
So... Huh?

59
05:17.818 --> 05:21.264
Let's start off with a drink.

60
05:21.264 --> 05:22.915
The night is young.

61
05:24.513 --> 05:25.708
Ms. Yamane.

62
05:25.708 --> 05:27.075
Thank you.

63
05:30.904 --> 05:36.071
He was a really important person to me.

64
05:36.071 --> 05:39.987
My one and only friend.

65
05:43.662 --> 05:46.755
Oh, it's all gone.

66
05:49.631 --> 05:51.184
Back then,

67
05:51.184 --> 05:55.838
you didn't have any romantic feelings for Taguchi?

68
05:58.256 --> 06:04.555
I've honestly never had any experience of romance.

69
06:06.187 --> 06:11.765
And what if our relationship changes...

70
06:15.789 --> 06:18.788
and things don't go well?

71
06:22.698 --> 06:24.660
Don't talk to me anymore.

72
06:34.441 --> 06:36.860
Drifting apart again would be...

73
06:39.251 --> 06:40.626
I don't want that.

74
06:46.731 --> 06:48.674
Sorry for the rambling.

75
06:51.674 --> 06:54.997
So... that's your concern?

76
06:57.280 --> 06:58.894
Huh?

77
06:58.894 --> 07:00.090
Well,

78
07:00.774 --> 07:04.720
breaking up is something that can happen after you start dating, right?

79
07:05.333 --> 07:10.388
So you're open... to the actual dating part?

80
07:17.091 --> 07:18.776
You're right.

81
07:19.888 --> 07:23.332
Wait, but...

82
07:23.332 --> 07:25.533
But...

83
07:25.533 --> 07:27.039
- Huh? - Oh?

84
07:27.039 --> 07:28.140
That's...

85
07:28.140 --> 07:29.715
Ms. Yamane.

86
07:30.801 --> 07:34.382
Let's ask Taguchi out on a date.

87
07:34.382 --> 07:36.522
- Huh? A date? - Yeah.

88
07:36.522 --> 07:40.163
And try holding his hand while you're at it.

89
07:40.163 --> 07:41.211
But we're not official!

90
07:41.211 --> 07:43.077
It's fine. It's a date.

91
07:43.967 --> 07:45.273
What?

92
07:46.174 --> 07:47.820
[Meigakusha]

93
07:47.820 --> 07:49.485
Need something?

94
07:52.567 --> 07:54.032
Well...

95
07:55.678 --> 07:57.076
Yeah?

96
08:03.223 --> 08:04.834
Well...

97
08:15.002 --> 08:16.458
I'm...

98
08:19.456 --> 08:21.642
I'm kinda sorry for causing you trouble.

99
08:22.825 --> 08:23.978
Huh?

100
08:25.649 --> 08:27.148
The thing I said.

101
08:37.434 --> 08:39.316
If it's too much for you,

102
08:40.649 --> 08:43.080
we can just stay friends like before.

103
08:48.558 --> 08:50.659
Taguchi...

104
08:52.244 --> 08:53.966
Is that really okay?

105
08:56.161 --> 08:57.384
It's okay.

106
08:59.339 --> 09:00.591
But...

107
09:06.882 --> 09:08.897
it wouldn't be ideal.

108
09:14.006 --> 09:16.560
I want to spend more time with you.

109
09:18.889 --> 09:20.898
I want to get closer to you.

110
09:27.205 --> 09:28.906
But, you know...

111
09:32.990 --> 09:35.779
Those are my feelings, not yours.

112
09:47.796 --> 09:49.171
Will you...

113
09:52.000 --> 09:57.446
go on a date with me?

114
10:02.307 --> 10:03.702
Really?

115
10:07.217 --> 10:08.441
Yeah.

116
10:12.238 --> 10:14.343
A date? I'm jealous.

117
10:14.343 --> 10:16.474
What do I do? My heart is...

118
10:16.474 --> 10:17.808
Hey, careful!

119
10:17.808 --> 10:19.969
Oh, sorry.

120
10:23.112 --> 10:27.236
Hey, are you gonna be okay going out like this?

121
10:27.236 --> 10:30.703
Oh, want me to press a pressure point to calm you down?

122
10:35.010 --> 10:38.311
Taguchi means a lot to me, but...

123
10:39.642 --> 10:44.732
I still can't tell if it's romance or just friendship.

124
10:47.998 --> 10:50.095
What do you think, Nagi?

125
10:53.069 --> 10:54.821
I don't think it is.

126
10:57.441 --> 11:00.092
Not that my opinion would change anything.

127
11:05.499 --> 11:09.808
The only one who can put a name to that "love" is you.

128
11:18.679 --> 11:21.022
There. All done.

129
11:22.349 --> 11:24.672
Wow, that's cute.

130
11:27.107 --> 11:28.439
Nagi.

131
11:30.557 --> 11:32.544
Thank you.

132
11:32.544 --> 11:34.001
No problem.

133
11:43.527 --> 11:46.139
Sorry for making you wait.

134
11:46.999 --> 11:48.390
Your hair...

135
11:49.467 --> 11:52.629
Oh, my brother styled it for me.

136
11:52.629 --> 11:54.193
It's not just your hair.

137
11:54.965 --> 11:57.362
You look really cute today.

138
11:57.362 --> 11:58.901
Beautiful, actually.

139
11:59.900 --> 12:01.737
Thank you.

140
12:03.922 --> 12:05.362
Well, then...

141
12:06.440 --> 12:08.042
Shall we head out?

142
12:08.042 --> 12:09.161
Yeah.

143
12:13.263 --> 12:16.502
We're going to a Japanese paper workshop today.

144
12:25.207 --> 12:27.481
- This is incredible. - Yeah.

145
12:29.958 --> 12:33.066
- Then you shake it like this. - Like this?

146
12:33.066 --> 12:35.889
- Put some feeling into it. - Okay.

147
12:35.889 --> 12:36.935
That's heavy!

148
12:36.935 --> 12:39.346
Yeah, it slowly gets heavier.

149
12:39.346 --> 12:41.212
- Is this right? - You got it.

150
12:45.619 --> 12:47.395
- That's cute. - Right?

151
12:49.002 --> 12:51.637
- You chose blue. - Yeah.

152
12:51.637 --> 12:53.071
It's Santa.

153
12:53.071 --> 12:54.341
So adorable.

154
12:54.341 --> 12:55.769
That's what we did earlier.

155
12:55.769 --> 12:57.126
Yeah.

156
12:58.704 --> 13:01.019
This bookmark is cute too.

157
13:01.019 --> 13:02.381
Shiori... ("Shiori" means "bookmark")

158
13:06.709 --> 13:08.656
Let's eat.

159
13:16.392 --> 13:18.252
Oh! It's delicious!

160
13:18.252 --> 13:20.645
- Really? - Yeah.

161
13:20.645 --> 13:22.775
Do you want to try some?

162
13:22.775 --> 13:25.821
Can I? Let me have a bite then.

163
13:27.000 --> 13:28.615
Here you go.

164
13:31.895 --> 13:35.277
Nothing. It just reminded me of what happened before.

165
13:39.973 --> 13:42.379
Food tastes better when I'm with you.

166
13:47.345 --> 13:48.911
Can I try some?

167
13:48.911 --> 13:50.080
Sure.

168
13:55.292 --> 13:57.770
We ended up in a nook again, huh?

169
13:59.049 --> 14:00.649
Sorry about that.

170
14:00.649 --> 14:01.899
What?

171
14:06.629 --> 14:10.483
Food tastes better when you eat with other people, huh?

172
14:10.483 --> 14:12.784
Nah, that wouldn't change the taste.

173
14:16.317 --> 14:18.652
Here, you can have this.

174
14:18.652 --> 14:21.293
Hey, stop trying to prove your point.

175
14:29.995 --> 14:32.457
What's important is "who" you eat with.

176
14:35.056 --> 14:36.630
I see.

177
14:37.302 --> 14:40.395
So it tastes good because I'm eating with you.

178
14:49.413 --> 14:50.867
Give me a bite.

179
14:50.867 --> 14:53.173
Oh, okay.

180
14:53.173 --> 14:56.813
- Here. - Quit offering it like a tribute.

181
15:00.006 --> 15:01.113
Hurry, hurry!

182
15:01.113 --> 15:02.426
What do you want to eat?

183
15:02.426 --> 15:03.453
I want cotton candy.

184
15:03.453 --> 15:05.213
Is it over there?

185
15:31.590 --> 15:32.865
Sorry.

186
15:37.490 --> 15:39.626
I don't want you tripping again.

187
15:43.227 --> 15:45.544
What? Feeling nervous?

188
15:46.490 --> 15:48.037
I'm not.

189
15:50.271 --> 15:51.633
I see.

190
15:56.542 --> 15:58.916
Go down this road and turn right.

191
15:58.916 --> 16:01.095
- Okay. - It should be over there.

192
16:01.095 --> 16:02.777
- Thank you! - Thank you so much!

193
16:02.777 --> 16:04.715
- That's great. - Yeah.

194
16:04.715 --> 16:08.723
By the way, are you here alone today?

195
16:08.723 --> 16:10.423
I'm waiting for someone.

196
16:10.423 --> 16:13.697
Oh, can I at least get your contact info?

197
16:13.697 --> 16:14.983
Is that okay?

198
16:14.983 --> 16:17.047
I'm really sorry.

199
16:17.047 --> 16:18.953
But if you'd like...

200
16:25.403 --> 16:27.590
I'm on a date.

201
16:27.590 --> 16:28.683
Oh.

202
16:28.683 --> 16:31.318
Sorry for bothering you.

203
16:31.318 --> 16:32.967
Let's go.

204
16:40.597 --> 16:42.226
You're not letting go?

205
16:45.097 --> 16:46.987
If we hold hands like this,

206
16:48.047 --> 16:51.885
people won't come up to you again, right?

207
17:04.484 --> 17:08.819
Yamane, you were totally nervous today, weren't you?

208
17:11.657 --> 17:14.239
Yeah. I really was.

209
17:19.082 --> 17:20.460
Me too.

210
17:21.781 --> 17:24.810
My heart was pounding so hard back then.

211
17:30.268 --> 17:32.566
When we held hands at the festival.

212
17:44.270 --> 17:45.717
I've...

213
17:47.979 --> 17:50.149
always been shy.

214
17:52.001 --> 17:54.343
When I was little,

215
17:54.343 --> 17:58.469
I was always hiding behind my brother.

216
18:04.437 --> 18:07.431
Back in elementary school,

217
18:07.431 --> 18:10.844
I got invited to a friend's birthday party.

218
18:13.177 --> 18:17.323
They said "everyone's invited", but...

219
18:19.569 --> 18:22.326
there was one kid who wasn't invited.

220
18:26.523 --> 18:31.622
I probably should've rejected her invitation.

221
18:32.361 --> 18:36.584
♪ Happy birthday dear Haruka ♪

222
18:36.584 --> 18:39.751
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

223
18:39.751 --> 18:42.858
Happy birthday!

224
18:46.186 --> 18:54.346
Since then, making new friends scared me.

225
18:56.423 --> 18:58.670
Even when I entered high school,

226
18:59.768 --> 19:03.033
I was so anxious.

227
19:11.323 --> 19:15.533
And that's when I met you.

228
19:18.909 --> 19:21.969
I was so happy

229
19:23.637 --> 19:25.657
to become friends with you.

230
19:29.606 --> 19:31.061
I was happy too.

231
19:47.533 --> 19:49.204
Should we get going?

232
20:02.619 --> 20:04.169
I was...

233
20:05.789 --> 20:08.115
I was scared this whole time.

234
20:11.253 --> 20:13.609
If our relationship changes...

235
20:15.048 --> 20:16.629
What if...

236
20:17.886 --> 20:20.919
What if it falls apart?

237
20:22.972 --> 20:28.511
I feel like we can't even go back to being friends this time.

238
20:39.198 --> 20:40.370
Yeah.

239
20:44.719 --> 20:46.750
Even so...

240
20:48.827 --> 20:51.492
I want to keep holding your hand.

241
20:59.927 --> 21:05.212
The joy of being together,

242
21:06.786 --> 21:10.065
the fear of being apart,

243
21:11.313 --> 21:13.625
and even the frustration...

244
21:19.367 --> 21:22.714
I want to say that all of it is love.

245
21:28.026 --> 21:30.301
Taguchi...

246
21:32.918 --> 21:34.481
I like you.

247
21:36.114 --> 21:40.624
So, if you feel the same,

248
21:43.888 --> 21:46.075
please go out with me.

249
22:01.498 --> 22:03.191
Are you sure?

250
22:07.549 --> 22:08.745
Yeah.

251
22:57.495 --> 23:00.312
I feel like I'm dying.

252
23:01.398 --> 23:06.510
Please go easy on me.

253
23:06.510 --> 23:09.734
No way. I can't.

254
23:09.734 --> 23:12.323
You always felt out of reach,

255
23:13.873 --> 23:18.246
and I was content just being by your side.

256
23:19.132 --> 23:22.747
I'm going that way. See you at school.

257
23:22.747 --> 23:23.834
Okay.

258
23:24.821 --> 23:26.183
Bye.

259
23:29.183 --> 23:30.494
But...

260
23:33.361 --> 23:34.929
From now on...

261
23:45.551 --> 23:48.001
I can't calm down around her.

262
23:48.001 --> 23:49.893
An office romance...

263
23:49.893 --> 23:51.860
Tell me all about your romance.

264
23:51.860 --> 23:53.364
Did you share the truth?

265
23:53.364 --> 23:55.100
I don't want to upset you.

266
23:55.100 --> 23:57.437
I want to know more about Taguchi.

267
23:57.437 --> 23:58.832
Yamane?
